          "body": "**一句話／白話**\n眼表受刺激後由 trigeminal afferent 回報，再由 facial parasympathetic pathway 叫淚腺分泌。\n\n**觀念**\ncorneal/conjunctival sensation 經 ophthalmic division of trigeminal nerve 傳入 brainstem；副交感輸出隨 facial nerve 經 greater petrosal nerve，到 pterygopalatine ganglion 換站，再到 lacrimal gland。\n\n**考試角度**\n- afferent：CN V1\n- efferent parasympathetic：CN VII → greater petrosal → pterygopalatine ganglion\n- 刺激眼表可引發 reflex tearing\n\n**口訣**\n感覺五進、分泌七出，中途翼腭神經節換站。",
